DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
5456::$$$message_0037_0000_0000$$$::"Whoa, when did we put this thing here?"[lr]::
5457::$$$message_0037_0000_0001$$$::It's been an hour since I started cleaning the shed.[lr]::
5458::$$$message_0037_0000_0002$$$::I got lightheaded seeing how much of a junkyard it's become.::
5459::$$$message_0037_0001_0000$$$::"Shirou, where should I put this metal plate?"[lr]::
5460::$$$message_0037_0001_0001$$$::...What's that?[lr]::
5461::$$$message_0037_0001_0002$$$::What's this plate the size of a small table doing in the shed?::
5462::$$$message_0037_0002_0000$$$::"...I don't remember seeing that before at all... Just take it outside for now."[lr]::
5463::$$$message_0037_0002_0001$$$::"Understood."::
5464::$$$message_0037_0003_0000$$$::For now, we move the stuff outside.[lr]::
5465::$$$message_0037_0003_0001$$$::Saber helps me tidy up the random junk without complaining even once.::
5466::$$$message_0037_0004_0000$$$::"Still...now that I look at all this again..."[lr]::
5467::$$$message_0037_0004_0001$$$::It's a mountain of junk about the size of a small car.[lr]::
5468::$$$message_0037_0004_0002$$$::If there's this much just on the ground floor of the shed, I'm afraid to imagine how much has piled up total.::
5469::$$$message_0037_0005_0000$$$::"Shirou, what is that metal plate used for?"[lr]::
5470::$$$message_0037_0005_0001$$$::"The one earlier? I think it might be a taiyaki mold. Why do we have that, anyway?"[lr]::
5471::$$$message_0037_0005_0002$$$::Moreover, it isn't for home use, but one of the large hinged versions you see at food stalls.[lr]::
5472::$$$message_0037_0005_0003$$$::There's also a takoyaki plate, a probable cotton candy machine, what looks like a Christmas tree, and even ice skates.::
5473::$$$message_0037_0006_0000$$$::"We could hold a whole festival using just the shed..."[lr]::
5474::$$$message_0037_0006_0001$$$::"Did you put all these things there?"[lr]::
5475::$$$message_0037_0006_0002$$$::"About half of it, yeah. The other half I've never seen before.[lr]::
5476::$$$message_0037_0006_0003$$$::Either way, it's all junk."::
5477::$$$message_0037_0007_0000$$$::Of course, I only brought back salvage that looks usable once repaired, not the stuff whose origins I have no clue about.::
5478::$$$message_0037_0008_0000$$$::"So you don't know where it comes from.[lr]::
5479::$$$message_0037_0008_0001$$$::Then, where do all these seemingly unrelated yet uncannily similar items come from?"[lr]::
5480::$$$message_0037_0008_0002$$$::It can only be one person.[lr]::
5481::$$$message_0037_0008_0003$$$::Saber's probably aware of who that is.[lr]::
5482::$$$message_0037_0008_0004$$$::She grunts.::
5483::$$$message_0037_0009_0000$$$::"Wow, this takes me back. What are you doing with all this stuff, Shirou? Getting ready for a festival?"[lr]::
5484::$$$message_0037_0009_0001$$$::Speak of the devil.[lr]::
5485::$$$message_0037_0009_0002$$$::The perpetrator's returned to the scene of the crime.::
5486::$$$message_0037_0010_0000$$$::"I'm tidying up, not getting ready.[lr]::
5487::$$$message_0037_0010_0001$$$::We don't know what to do with all this junk that a certain someone brought from who knows where."::
5488::$$$message_0037_0011_0000$$$::"J-junk? That's rude! I brought most of it here for you."[lr]::
5489::$$$message_0037_0011_0001$$$::"You mean he wanted these things?"::
5490::$$$message_0037_0012_0000$$$::"Yeah. I saw him pressed up against a store window staring at the metal board for hours.[lr]::
5491::$$$message_0037_0012_0001$$$::I'm a good big sister who remembers these things, so when I come across them at home, I've been gifting them to Shirou for years."::
5492::$$$message_0037_0013_0000$$$::"Indeed?[lr]::
5493::$$$message_0037_0013_0001$$$::You're the model of a thoughtful sister, Taiga."[lr]::
5494::$$$message_0037_0013_0002$$$::"I know, right!?[lr]::
5495::$$$message_0037_0013_0003$$$::But Shirou doesn't put any of them to use. He just dumps them in the shed and forgets about them."::
5496::$$$message_0037_0014_0000$$$::"Now hold on, Fuji-nee. You too, Saber.[lr]::
5497::$$$message_0037_0014_0001$$$::Don't you think something's wrong with what you just said?"[lr]::
5498::$$$message_0037_0014_0002$$$::"What? It's good, isn't it?"::
5499::$$$message_0037_0015_0000$$$::"Listen, I might've wanted one once, but that was years ago. I was just obsessed with the food stalls as a kid, but about the only thing I want these days is a new frying pan.[lr]::
5500::$$$message_0037_0015_0001$$$::For example..."[lr]::
5501::$$$message_0037_0015_0002$$$::I pause and point at the taiyaki plate.::
5502::$$$message_0037_0016_0000$$$::"Tell me how I'm supposed to use this thing."[lr]::
5503::$$$message_0037_0016_0001$$$::"What are you talking about?[lr]::
5504::$$$message_0037_0016_0002$$$::It's a plate for cooking taiyaki, so just make taiyaki with it."[lr]::
5505::$$$message_0037_0016_0003$$$::"Heavens! You mean we could make taiyaki at home using this?"::
5506::$$$message_0037_0017_0000$$$::...Sorry, Saber.[lr]::
5507::$$$message_0037_0017_0001$$$::I hate to shatter your dreams, but that's a commercial griddle. It won't be any use at home.::
5508::$$$message_0037_0018_0000$$$::"It won't work, Saber. We can't make taiyaki with that.[lr]::
5509::$$$message_0037_0018_0001$$$::How did you [cacheimage storage=セイバー私服01c(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=セイバー私服01c(中) textoff=0]plan on using this to make taiyaki anyway, Fuji-nee?"[lr]::
5510::$$$message_0037_0018_0002$$$::"How? I thought you knew."::
5511::$$$message_0037_0019_0000$$$::"I do! But we don't have a big enough burner for that.[lr]::
5512::$$$message_0037_0019_0001$$$::How do you expect me to heat a griddle that's half the size of a tatami floorboard, you dumb tiger?"[lr]::
5513::$$$message_0037_0019_0002$$$::"Oof. I only got it because you said you wanted one."::
5514::$$$message_0037_0020_0000$$$::"I never said that, and how do you even remember these things?[lr]::
5515::$$$message_0037_0020_0001$$$::...I do appreciate the thought, though.[lr]::
5516::$$$message_0037_0020_0002$$$::Where'd you find it?"[lr]::
5517::$$$message_0037_0020_0003$$$::"Someone left it behind after a festival at our place."[lr]::
5518::$$$message_0037_0020_0004$$$::"Ah..."::
5519::$$$message_0037_0021_0000$$$::She must've taken it after the group left it behind at some street festival.[lr]::
5520::$$$message_0037_0021_0001$$$::I can already hear Grandpa Raiga yelling at one of the young members of the Fujimura Group for failing to keep track of their equipment.[lr]::
5521::$$$message_0037_0021_0002$$$::...Poor guy.[lr]::
5522::$$$message_0037_0021_0003$$$::I'm sure this isn't the first time, so I should bring it back when I get a chance.::
5523::$$$message_0037_0022_0000$$$::"Shirou."[lr]::
5524::$$$message_0037_0022_0001$$$::Saber pauses over something in the pile of junk.::
5525::$$$message_0037_0023_0000$$$::"Saber? What'd you find?"[lr]::
5526::$$$message_0037_0023_0001$$$::Did she see some dangerous magical item in there?[lr]::
5527::$$$message_0037_0023_0002$$$::I rush over to Saber.::
5528::$$$message_0037_0024_0000$$$::"What is this?"[lr]::
5529::$$$message_0037_0024_0001$$$::She's holding a shaved ice maker.[lr]::
5530::$$$message_0037_0024_0002$$$::Unlike the commercial models used at festivals, this is a penguin-shaped residential model.[lr]::
5531::$$$message_0037_0024_0003$$$::Saber's staring into the penguin's eyes, spellbound.::
5532::$$$message_0037_0025_0000$$$::"It's a tool used to make shaved ice."[lr]::
5533::$$$message_0037_0025_0001$$$::"Sh-shaved ice... [wvl canskip=false time=500]Something this adorable can be used to make ice candy?"[lr]::
5534::$$$message_0037_0025_0002$$$::...She seems shocked that something cute could be useful.[lr]::
5535::$$$message_0037_0025_0003$$$::Her hands tremble a little holding the penguin.::
5536::$$$message_0037_0026_0000$$$::"Okay. Why don't we try it out once we finish up here?"[lr]::
5537::$$$message_0037_0026_0001$$$::I did work up a sweat,[lr]::
5538::$$$message_0037_0026_0002$$$::so I'll reward myself.::
5539::$$$message_0037_0027_0000$$$::Unfortunately, I don't have any syrup on hand.[lr]::
5540::$$$message_0037_0027_0001$$$::I'll just whip up something with matcha and sugar and chill it in the refrigerator.::
5541::$$$message_0037_0028_0000$$$::As for the other street festival appliances, I gave the Fujimura Group a call once I finished cleaning...[lr]::
5542::$$$message_0037_0028_0001$$$::"Oh, here it is..."[lr]::
5543::$$$message_0037_0028_0002$$$::The men from the Group come to collect both Fuji-nee and the appliances. They sound utterly resigned.::
5544::$$$message_0037_0029_0000$$$::"I'll apologize to Grandpa and be right back, so make sure you leave some for me![lr]::
5545::$$$message_0037_0029_0001$$$::...But if I take a really long time, I'd appreciate it if you'd come rescue me."[lr]::
5546::$$$message_0037_0029_0002$$$::She won't be back for a while.::
5547::$$$message_0037_0030_0000$$$::"Shirou, how is this used?"[lr]::
5548::$$$message_0037_0030_0001$$$::The shaved ice machine sits on a table, washed and sparkling clean. Saber's staring at it with obvious interest.::
5549::$$$message_0037_0031_0000$$$::"Mm, hold on."[lr]::
5550::$$$message_0037_0031_0001$$$::I place a dish in front of the penguin's belly.[lr]::
5551::$$$message_0037_0031_0002$$$::[se storage=se560.wav]When I open up the head [chgfg time=200 storage=セイバー私服01c(中) textoff=0]and put the ice in, Saber looks a little sad.[se storage=se560.wav]::
5552::$$$message_0037_0032_0000$$$::"It isn't very...cute that it opens right there."[lr]::
5553::$$$message_0037_0032_0001$$$::"Haha. Yeah, they went for function over form right here."::
5554::$$$message_0037_0033_0000$$$::I chuckle wryly while working the knob on its head.[lr]::
5555::$$$message_0037_0033_0001$$$::Ground ice begins to fill the receptacle.[lr]::
5556::$$$message_0037_0033_0002$$$::[move time=150 path=(234,74,255)(221,85,255)(234,77,255)(248,84,255)(258,77,255)(265,85,255)(258,77,255)(248,84,255)(234,77,255)(225,84,255) storage=セイバー私服01e頬(中) accel=0 spline=1 textoff=0]Saber's trying to keep her composure, but she's brimming with curiosity.::
5557::$$$message_0037_0034_0000$$$::"Shirou, do these machines come in any other shapes? Um, like a lion or a leopard?"[lr]::
5558::$$$message_0037_0034_0001$$$::"Mm..."[lr]::
5559::$$$message_0037_0034_0002$$$::...Uh oh.[lr]::
5560::$$$message_0037_0034_0003$$$::I've seen Saber like this countless times, but her unexpected personality makes me smile every time.::
5561::$$$message_0037_0035_0000$$$::"Shirou, why are you turning away from me?[lr]::
5562::$$$message_0037_0035_0001$$$::The ice will melt if you stop turning the handle. You should keep grinding it."[lr]::
5563::$$$message_0037_0035_0002$$$::"Oh, sorry. Um... I don't know, but I think there might be lion-shaped ones."::
5564::$$$message_0037_0036_0000$$$::"What? Is that true?"[lr]::
5565::$$$message_0037_0036_0001$$$::"Well, I've never seen one, but it wouldn't surprise me if they existed."[lr]::
5566::$$$message_0037_0036_0002$$$::I move my hand in a repetitive motion.[lr]::
5567::$$$message_0037_0036_0003$$$::Once the dish is full, I remove it, add the matcha syrup, and pass it to Saber.[lr]::
5568::$$$message_0037_0036_0004$$$::She happily accepts it and picks up the spoon. Then she looks at me.::
5569::$$$message_0037_0037_0000$$$::"Are you going to have any?"[lr]::
5570::$$$message_0037_0037_0001$$$::"This is enough for me."[lr]::
5571::$$$message_0037_0037_0002$$$::I show her the cup of tea I made.::
5572::$$$message_0037_0038_0000$$$::"...I see. Then, if you don't mind..."[lr]::
5573::$$$message_0037_0038_0001$$$::She brings a scoop of shaved ice to her mouth.[lr]::
5574::$$$message_0037_0038_0002$$$::Saber looks calm, but she must have been looking forward to this moment.[lr]::
5575::$$$message_0037_0038_0003$$$::After one bite, she nods. She gives me and the penguin one look, and then begins eating in earnest.::
5576::$$$message_0037_0039_0000$$$::"Did you not have anything like this in your time?"[lr]::
5577::$$$message_0037_0039_0001$$$::"...Well, I had heard such luxuries existed.[lr]::
5578::$$$message_0037_0039_0002$$$::But we had not yet invented cooling chambers like the ones you have now."[lr]::
5579::$$$message_0037_0039_0003$$$::She adds that only a few people enjoyed such luxuries, and returns to conquering the shaved ice.::
5580::$$$message_0037_0040_0000$$$::"Uh, Saber. Shaved ice does melt fast, but if you eat it that fast..."[lr]::
5581::$$$message_0037_0040_0001$$$::My warning comes too late. Saber suddenly stops moving, her face pale.::
5582::$$$message_0037_0041_0000$$$::"I was going to warn you about the headache, but too late."[lr]::
5583::$$$message_0037_0041_0001$$$::I hand my tea to Saber, who nods with tears in her eyes.[lr]::
5584::$$$message_0037_0041_0002$$$::Saber gulps down my hot tea in one go.::
5585::$$$message_0037_0042_0000$$$::"...What, Shirou?[lr]::
5586::$$$message_0037_0042_0001$$$::Is it that strange to get a headache from the ice?"[lr]::
5587::$$$message_0037_0042_0002$$$::"Huh? No, it isn't strange, just...[lr]::
5588::$$$message_0037_0042_0003$$$::Come on, it's going to melt while you're talking."[lr]::
5589::$$$message_0037_0042_0004$$$::"...Is that so?"::
5590::$$$message_0037_0043_0000$$$::She eyes me doubtfully, but seems more concerned with the ice, and immediately resumes enjoying it.::
5591::$$$message_0037_0044_0000$$$::"...I might find one if I go to Shinto."[lr]::
5592::$$$message_0037_0044_0001$$$::"Shirou? Are you thinking about something?[lr]::
5593::$$$message_0037_0044_0002$$$::Hrm. Did you want some of the shaved ice after all?"[lr]::
5594::$$$message_0037_0044_0003$$$::"Yeah. But next time.[lr]::
5595::$$$message_0037_0044_0004$$$::I'll buy some real syrup next time, and somehow..."[lr]::
5596::$$$message_0037_0044_0005$$$::"?"::
5597::$$$message_0037_0045_0000$$$::Saber tilts her head curiously.[lr]::
5598::$$$message_0037_0045_0001$$$::If there is a next time, I'll somehow get a job at a warehouse in Shinto and find one of those uncommon lion-shaped shaved ice machines.[lr]::
5599::$$$message_0037_0045_0002$$$::...Until then, I'll hold off eating shaved ice together with Saber.::

